OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMen charged over alleged plot to target
OL,4,AManchester Jewish community
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe duo were arrested in the Northern
OL,7,FQuarter area of the city, when
OL,8,Fthousands of British Jews were in
OL,9,Fsynagogues.
OL,11,FHome Secretary Shabana Mahmood said the
OL,12,Fnews two Iranian men have been charged
OL,13,Fover an alleged plot in the Manchester
OL,14,Farea would be "deeply distressing" to
OL,15,Fthe Jewish community.
